ass=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">N/A</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">$14/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">$17/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unobtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 266px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6c/Planked_Rainbow_Wood.png/revision/latest?cb=20250824031745\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Planked Rainbow Wood\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6c/Planked_Rainbow_Wood.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/266?cb=20250824031745\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"266\" height=\"142\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Planked Rainbow Wood.png\" data-image-key=\"Planked_Rainbow_Wood.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Planked_Rainbow_Wood.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Planked Rainbow Wood</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Rainbow Tree</b> is a tree added during the <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">2025 April Fools update</a>, and was removed 7 days later. The tree requires dynamite to cut it down. It can prove to be a challenge to gather as its gravity is inverted. The only way to make the gravity of the wood normal is to plank it, however the wood loses it's rainbow color when sanded or planked and turns white. \n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This tree was available from 4/1/2025 Until 4/7/2025.</li>\n<li>It is impossible to cut this tree with any axe, you must use dynamite to cut it down.</li>\n<li>The tree's Gravity is inverted to regular Trees</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902133543\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 67/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/